# NexiGo HelloCam (NexiGo N930W / HelloCam Pro, USB 3443:930d) and the
# 3443:c803 sibling.
#
# uvcvideo exposes the standard UVC units but ignores extension units whose
# GUID it does not know.  On this camera the Microsoft extension unit
# (MS_CAMERA_CONTROL_XU, {0f3f95dc-2632-4c4e-92c9-a04782f43bc8}) carries the
# IR illuminator / face-authentication mode and the frame-metadata switch, so
# userspace needs write access to the usbfs node to reach them.
#
# TAG+="uaccess" grants that to the user logged in on the seat, the same way
# PipeWire gets the video nodes; nothing is granted to other users, and the
# access disappears when the device is unplugged.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="3443", ATTR{idProduct}=="930d", TAG+="uaccess"
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTR{idVendor}=="3443", ATTR{idProduct}=="c803", TAG+="uaccess"
